financebench_id_01858,Does 3M maintain a stable trend of dividend distribution?,"Yes, not only they distribute the dividends on a routine basis, 3M has also been increasing the per share dividend for consecutive 65 years",3M_2023Q2_10Q,novel-generated,"Yes, 3M has maintained a stable trend of dividend distribution. The company has consistently paid dividends since 1916, and as of 2023, it marked the 65th consecutive year of dividend increases. For example, in February 2023, 3M’s Board of Directors declared a first-quarter dividend of $1.50 per share, reflecting a 1% increase from the previous year, which translates to an annualized dividend of $6.00 per share (source: 3M 2022 10-K report). Additionally, in 2022, the annual dividend was $6.00 per share, and in 2018, it was $5.76 per share (source: 3M 2018 10-K report and 2022 10-K report). This consistent increase in dividends indicates a stable trend in 3M's dividend distribution.",,,"[""3M_2018_10K"", ""3M_2023Q2_10Q"", ""3M_2022_10K""]","Source: data\pdfs\3M_2018_10K.pdf

