On January 3, 2023, we issued warrants to purchase 300,260 shares of our common stock to a  commercial  partner pursuant to a strategic arrangement
executed in 2018 with such partner. The warrants have an exercise price of $25.4994 per share and expire on January 3, 2026. The warrants were issued
