Executive has been reimbursed by American Water for all business expenses incurred in conjunction with the performance of Executive’s employment and
that no other reimbursements are owed to Executive; and (iii) Executive has not suffered any on-the-job injury for which Executive has not already filed a
claim.
8.
Accrued Benefits. In addition to the consideration provided under this Agreement, following the Separation Date, Executive will be entitled to receive (i)
any accrued, but unused, vacation as of the Separation Date, which will be paid to Executive on the first Company payroll date that follows the Separation
