Additionally, Dillon was the CEO of U.S. Cellular before her time at Ulta, further solidifying her executive background in managing retail operations (Source: Foot Locker 2022 8-K).",,,"[""FOOTLOCKER_2022_8K_dated_2022-08-19""]","Source: data\pdfs\FOOTLOCKER_2022_8K_dated_2022-08-19.pdf

