Australia, and New Zealand
as well as websites and mobile apps, the Company's purpose is to inspire and empower youth culture around the world, by
fueling a shared
passion for self-expression and creating unrivaled experiences at the heart of the global sneaker community. Foot Locker, Inc. has its
corporate headquarters in New York. For additional information please visit footlocker-inc.com.
 
 
