succession
plan, and with a strong foundation in place and ongoing momentum against our strategic objectives, we believe now is the right
time to complete the CEO
transition. We are confident that Mary is the ideal person to serve as Foot Locker’s next CEO and lead
the Company forward. Mary has established a
remarkable track

