cts/franchises. Additional information on Johnson & Johnson, including adjusted income before tax by segment, a  pharmaceutical pipeline of selected compounds in late stage development and a copy of today’s earnings call presentation can also be found in the Investors section of the company's website at  quarterly-results.NOTE TO INVESTORS CONCERNING FORWARD-LOOKING STATEMENTS:This press release contains “forward-looking statements” as defined in the Private Securities Litigation Reform Act of 1995 regarding, among other things: future operating and financial performance

