dules of the earnings release and the Investors section of the company's website at quarterly-results. Copies of the financial schedules accompanying this earnings release are available on the company’s website at quarterly-results. These schedules include supplementary sales data, a condensed consolidated statement of earnings, reconciliations of non-GAAP financial measures, and sales of key products/franchises. Additional information on Johnson & Johnson, including adjusted income before tax by segment, a  pharmaceutical pipeline of selected compounds in late stage development and a copy

