financebench_id_01484,How did JnJ's US sales growth compare to international sales growth in FY2022?,US sales increased 3.0% vs international sales decline of 0.6%.,JOHNSON_JOHNSON_2022Q4_EARNINGS,novel-generated,"In FY2022, Johnson & Johnson's sales growth in the U.S. was 3.0%, while international sales experienced a slight decline of 0.6%. Overall, J&J reported a total worldwide sales growth of 1.3% for the year. The contrasting trends illustrate that, despite some operational strengths, international sales faced challenges that impacted their growth negatively compared to U.S. sales (Source: data\pdfs\JOHNSON_JOHNSON_2022_10K.pdf).",,,"[""JOHNSON_JOHNSON_2022_10K"", ""JOHNSON_JOHNSON_2023_8K_dated-2023-08-30"", ""JOHNSON_JOHNSON_2022Q4_EARNINGS"", ""JOHNSON_JOHNSON_2023Q2_EARNINGS""]","Source: data\pdfs\JOHNSON_JOHNSON_2022Q4_EARNINGS.pdf

